  <code>global.roomID = 21;
global.msg = "Since Armamented Locks bypass curses, their glitch mimic can be different from both the glitch curse's mimic and the mimic of the door's base glitch. I don't know if you can make a puzzle out of it, but it is possible to give a door three distinct glitch mimics, although the curse's mimic will necessarily be glitch. Try to do that, here.";
global.rm = "CX-5F";</code>
